---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Uses - Amirdaraee">
  <div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12 text-center mb-4">
        <img
          src="/amirdaraee-setup.jpg"
          class="img-fluid rounded"
          alt="amirdaraee-setup"
          style="max-width: 60%;"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12">
        <h3>Uses</h3>
        <p>
          Uses is a website developer by Wes Bos. In order to answer
          questions about the software or hardware that a developer uses daily
          each developer get to have a uses page on their website so they can
          easily show their tools.
        </p>
        <p>Check Uses Github repo to find out more</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12">
        <h4>Editor + Terminal</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Visual Studio Code:</strong> as for my personal
            projects and websites, I use VS Code which is in my mind one of the
            best editors out there.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Visual Studio Code Theme:</strong> after googling alot
            and asking around I choosed Dracula as for my main theme in VS Code.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Visual Studio 2019:</strong> currently at my work I'm
            using Visual Studio 2019 as my IDE alongside Resharper by JetBrains.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12">
        <h4>Desktop Apps</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Figma:</strong> as for my design tool, I use Figma for
            all of my projects.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12">
        <h4>Desk Setup</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Samsung C24F390 Monitor 24 Inch:</strong> Is my main
            monitor.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>PC Setup:</strong> Motherboard: Asus H87M-E,
            CPU: Intel Corei5-4440, GPU: Geforce GT-730, Memory: 8GB
            DDR3.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>My Laptop:</strong> Is a Surface Book Series 1 with
            Corei5, 8GB Memory, 120GB SSD.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
